<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $46 (FIM 210.12).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $46 (FIM 210.12).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed down $0-1/2 at $46 in New York on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 210.12 markka. In Helsinki on Tuesday, Nokia A closed up 1.40 markka at 216.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed down $0-3/8 at $32 on Wall Street. The price equals about 73.09 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 0.30 markka at 73.70.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed unchanged at $18 in New York on Tuesday. The price equals about 82.22 markka.</p>
<p>Rauma closed unchanged at 85.00 markka in Helsinki.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
</text>
